      "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a1fe7c-175c-749e-a7df-5812e6f9b5df -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 Quickstart worker leaves the scheduled report pending\n\nThis change schedules deliveries on `report-dispatch`, but the [`README.md`](https://github.com/hasansyed-proofline/bench-proofline/blob/fcb0c2a94196532d3d49af8d99d731474b00c1c2/README.md?plain=1#L5-L8) quickstart still runs the worker on `reports`.\n\nOn a fresh database, the documented worker processes zero jobs and leaves the due report pending.\n\nUpdate the quickstart worker command to use `--queue report-dispatch`.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a1fe4f-49f1-7732-81cb-f1d6ad806605/reviews/01a1fe7b-7725-72ec-ae66-b41148314d72/findings/01a1fe7c-1761-76d8-92ac-b32d0e27eaf2)",
